.env

# `.env` on its own does not match `.env.txt` — which is exactly what Notepad saves
# when you don't pick "All Files" in the dialog. Copies made that way have held real
# keys, so match every variant and re-admit only the placeholder example.
.env.*
*.env
*.env.*
!.env.example

# Loose credential files. A GitHub token was once saved in this repo as a plain file
# named after the token itself; a public repo is an unforgiving place to discover that.
# Keep credentials in a password manager or Windows Credential Manager, not on disk.
*github_pat*
ghp_*
gho_*
sb_secret_*
sk-*
*.pem
*.key
*.token
*.credentials

# Full-quality renders written by the worker. Large binaries, never source.
masters
